            <ArticleTitle>Advances in interventional cardiology: higher risk patients demand greater vigilance.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>11-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Specialized devices, such as stents, are being used with or replacing balloon angioplasty. About 25% of the 900,000 global angioplasties performed in 1995 included stenting. By the millennium, stenting will have overtaken all other therapies, including bypass graft surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
